"descrição expandida, rastreabilidade de fontes e interpretação científica coerente no ambiente da"
" própria Argiloteca."
msgstr ""
"The structure of the catalog considers criteria such as layer type, arrangements 1:1 and 2:1, di-"
" or trioctaedral character, groups of hydrated phyllosilicates, chlorites, smectites, argile "
"micas and interstratified materials. Thus, the page serves as a basis of consultation for "
"expanded description, traceability of sources and coherent scientific interpretation in the "
"environment of the site itself. Argiloteca."

msgid ""
"A família caulinítica reúne filossilicatos 1:1 aluminossilicatados, muito frequentes em perfis de"
